Subject: D27/24A446 native V2 KPI bindings for the no-monitor port

Image4 V2 exports explicitly report unavailable monitor operations, rather
than fabricating policy or nonce updates. The guard refuses monitor builds.
The DriverKit API uses generated IORPC dispatch with the original message ID;
the kernel implementation only calls the registered dictionary handler.

